### 1. External Dependencies Identified

In the original implementation, the core orchestration layer (`BenchmarkAssistantAgent`, `GeminiProvider`, `ChatSession`, and `DegenKeyPooler`) suffered from tight coupling, direct instantiations, and unmockable static calls:

| Dependency Type | Concrete Issue in Codebase | Introduced Abstraction |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Network / APIs** | Direct global `fetch(...)` inside `GeminiProvider` reaching Google Generative Language REST endpoints. | [`IHttpClient`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L22-L28) / [`FetchHttpClient`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/defaults.ts#L24-L56) |
| **Configuration** | Hardcoded URLs (`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta`), default models, and raw API key strings. | [`IGeminiConfig`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L30-L36) |
| **System Time** | Static `new Date()` and `Date.now()` inside `ChatSession` and `DegenKeyPooler` for timestamps and rate-limit cooldowns. | [`IClock`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L12-L16) / [`SystemClock`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/defaults.ts#L3-L12) |
| **ID Generation** | Non-deterministic `Math.random()` and `Date.now()` string concatenation for session and message IDs (`msg-...`, `k_...`). | [`IIdGenerator`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L18-L20) / [`DefaultIdGenerator`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/defaults.ts#L14-L22) |
| **Data Source (DB/Catalog)** | Concrete `BenchmarkCatalog` tightly coupled to providers and agents. | [`IBenchmarkCatalog`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L55-L78) |
| **Session State** | `BenchmarkAssistantAgent` directly instantiated `new ChatSession("benchmark-agent-session")`. | [`IChatSession`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L40-L52) |
| **LLM Orchestrator** | Direct instantiation of `new GeminiProvider`, `new MockCatalogAssistantProvider`, and `new LLMClient`. | [`ILLMClient`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts#L54-L59), [`ILLMProvider`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/chat/LLMProvider.ts#L10-L15) |

---

### 2. Abstractions & DI Container Setup

The following modules were added to establish clean dependency injection:

- [`src/core/di/interfaces.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/interfaces.ts): Pure contracts (`IClock`, `IIdGenerator`, `IHttpClient`, `IGeminiConfig`, `IChatSession`, `ILLMClient`, `IBenchmarkCatalog`, `IDependencyContainer`).
- [`src/core/di/tokens.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/tokens.ts): Type-safe resolution tokens (`TOKENS.Clock`, `TOKENS.HttpClient`, `TOKENS.BenchmarkAgent`, etc.).
- [`src/core/di/container.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/container.ts): Zero-dependency IoC container supporting instance and factory registrations (singleton and transient) with child scoping.
- [`src/core/di/defaults.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/defaults.ts): Production default implementations (`SystemClock`, `DefaultIdGenerator`, `FetchHttpClient`).
- [`src/core/di/bootstrap.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/di/bootstrap.ts): Composition root (`createBenchmarkContainer`) wiring default dependencies.

---

### 3. Refactored Code

#### A. Main Orchestrator: [`BenchmarkAssistantAgent.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/chat/BenchmarkAssistantAgent.ts)
Direct class instantiations were removed. Dependencies are injected via constructor:

```typescript
import { IBenchmarkCatalog, IChatSession, ILLMClient } from "../di/interfaces";
import { createBenchmarkContainer } from "../di/bootstrap";
import { TOKENS } from "../di/tokens";
import { GeminiProvider } from "./GeminiProvider";
import { MockCatalogAssistantProvider } from "./MockCatalogAssistantProvider";
import { ILLMProvider } from "./LLMProvider";

export interface BenchmarkAssistantAgentDependencies {
  session: IChatSession;
  client: ILLMClient;
  catalog?: IBenchmarkCatalog;
  geminiProvider?: GeminiProvider;
  mockProvider?: ILLMProvider;
}

export class BenchmarkAssistantAgent {
  readonly catalog?: IBenchmarkCatalog;
  readonly session: IChatSession;
  readonly client: ILLMClient;
  readonly geminiProvider?: GeminiProvider;
  readonly mockProvider?: ILLMProvider;

  constructor(
    catalogOrDeps: IBenchmarkCatalog | BenchmarkAssistantAgentDependencies,
    geminiApiKey?: string
  ) {
    // 1. Pure Constructor Dependency Injection path
    if ("session" in catalogOrDeps && "client" in catalogOrDeps) {
      this.session = catalogOrDeps.session;
      this.client = catalogOrDeps.client;
      this.catalog = catalogOrDeps.catalog;
      this.geminiProvider = catalogOrDeps.geminiProvider;
      this.mockProvider = catalogOrDeps.mockProvider;
      return;
    }

    // 2. Composition root path via DI container (preserves backward compatibility)
    const catalog = catalogOrDeps as IBenchmarkCatalog;
    const container = createBenchmarkContainer({ catalog, geminiApiKey });

    this.catalog = catalog;
    this.session = container.resolve<IChatSession>(TOKENS.ChatSession);
    this.geminiProvider = container.resolve<GeminiProvider>(TOKENS.GeminiProvider);
    this.mockProvider = container.resolve<MockCatalogAssistantProvider>(TOKENS.MockProvider);
    this.client = container.resolve<ILLMClient>(TOKENS.LLMClient);
  }

  setGeminiApiKey(key: string): void {
    if (this.geminiProvider) {
      this.geminiProvider.setApiKey(key);
      if (this.geminiProvider.isAvailable()) {
        this.client.setPrimaryProvider(this.geminiProvider);
      } else if (this.mockProvider) {
        this.client.setPrimaryProvider(this.mockProvider);
      }
    }
  }

  async ask(userQuestion: string): Promise<string> {
    const trimmed = userQuestion.trim();
    if (!trimmed) return "";

    this.session.addMessage("user", trimmed);

    try {
      const response = await this.client.dispatchMessage(this.session);
      this.session.addMessage("assistant", response);
      return response;
    } catch (err: any) {
      const errorMsg = `Wystąpił błąd podczas generowania odpowiedzi: ${err?.message || String(err)}`;
      this.session.addMessage("assistant", errorMsg);
      return errorMsg;
    }
  }

  reset(): void {
    this.session.clear();
  }
}
```

#### B. API Provider: [`GeminiProvider.ts`](https://github.com/hubi666hubi/free-llm-api-benchmarks/blob/main/src/core/chat/GeminiProvider.ts)
Replaced direct `fetch()` call with injected `IHttpClient` and `IGeminiConfig`:

